{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gegevens onderzoeken Werkgroep Reizigers Omvang en Omvang Verkopen (WROOV) 1980-2011"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:56213"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ARVODI"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ministerie van Infrastructuur en Milieu"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gerben Zwart"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Panteia"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Binnen de WROOV-onderzoeken zijn gedurende een periode van bijna 30 jaar gegevens verzameld en bepaalde prestatie-indicatoren berekend inzake het stads- en streekvervoer in Nederland.<\/p><p>De WROOV-onderzoeken hadden tot doel:<br>- het verdelen van opbrengsten van landelijk geldende vervoerbewijzen;<br>- het meten van de vervoerprestatie in het stads- en streekvervoer.<\/p><p>Na afronding van het laatste onderzoek in 2009 zijn de gegevens nu beschikbaar en bestaan uit de volgende delen:<br>- Deel 1 – Verkopen<br>- Deel 2 – Verdeelde opbrengsten en kilometers<br>- Deel 3 – Reisgedrag<br>- Deel 4 – Vervoeraanbod<br>- Deel 5 – Samenstelling concessies<br>- Deel 6 – Tariefinformatie<br>- Deel 7 – Documenten<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2013-12-02"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Business and Management","Earth and Environmental Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"WROOV"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Reizigersopbrengsten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Reizigerskilometers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stadsvervoer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Streekvervoer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"BTM"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vervoeraanbod"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tarieven"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Concessies"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Openbaar Vervoer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nationale Vervoer Bewijzen (NVB)"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De dataset is aanvankelijk op 11 december 2013 gepubliceerd. Uit analyses van de deponeerder is kort hierna gebleken dat er in de reisgedragbestanden van 1994, 1997, 2000, 2004 en 2005 een paar onvolkomenheden zaten. Op 19 februari 2014 is de dataset opnieuw gepubliceerd met de gecorrigeerde bestanden. Deze bestanden hebben het achtervoegsel '_v2' (versie 2) in de bestandsnaam gekregen."},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"G.H.K. Zwart (Panteia BV)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-12-16"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-12-02"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["WROOV-onderzoeken"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D44000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D70000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D15700"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D44000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Verkeerswetenschappen en vervoerswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Traffic and transport studies"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D70000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Economie en bedrijfskunde"},{"lang":"en","value":"Economics and Business Administration"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classi